STEP 1: GATHER
ASK "Which folder?" into {folder}
List {folder} with $fs_list and keep the files as {files}.
STEP 2: WORK
FOR EACH {f} in {files}:
    IF {f.name} is "notes.txt":
        Summarise {f} as #pitching says.
    ELSE IF {f} is empty:
        Skip it.
    ELSE:
        RETRY 2 times:
            Read {f.name} with $fs_read.
RETURN "Read {files.length} files"
